{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34189","headline":"次幽独君韵 二 · 陆龟蒙","name":"次幽独君韵 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"落日送万古，秋声含七哀。\n枯株不萧瑟，枝干虚崔嵬。\n伊昔临大道，歌钟醉高台。\n台今已平地，祗有春风回。\n明月白草死，积阴荒陇推。\n圣贤亦如此，恸绝真悠哉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34189.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34189","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}